      "timestamp": "2026-11-21T22:27:29",
      "actor": "Adv. Suresh Rao",
      "role": "Prosecution Counsel",
      "kind": "statement",
      "text": "Your Honour, the State alleges that on March 15 the accused committed armed robbery at the SBI Ashok Nagar branch, threatening the cashier with a firearm and fleeing with Rs. 24 lakhs.",
